  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Economic Crimes - Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist Government of Sri Lanka stakeholders in the development of their anti-money laundering and countering the financing of terrorism (AML/CFT) regime, to include supporting the effectiveness of the financial intelligence unit (FIU); enhancing risk-based AML/CFT supervision of the financial system; and improving money laundering case development and asset forfeiture.</narrative>
  </description>
